Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:35:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 44/51] B70-V2-HC: fold hc_silu into the parallel HC down
 finish kernel (B70_HC_SILU_FUSE=1)

_hc_finish_silu writes the down output and silu(down[:, :lora]/HC) from the stored BF16 value.
GatedResidual._down_and_silu uses it when the ordered projection takes the parallel route
(rows <= 32); the route predicate is shared with ordered_hc_gemm. 97 kernels per c=1
step. Default off; bitwise-identical (CPU interpreter tests).
